            "body": "> 5\\. `:messages`, The output is a little weird.  I expect there should only be 3 lines of output?\n\nNo bug. The replay happens for the preview, as well as the cascade.\n\n> issue1\n\nFixed by https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/42020\n\n> issue2\n\nA Visual-mode mapping that edits the buffer without ending Visual mode  (e.g. `<Cmd>lua vim.api.nvim_buf_set_text(…)<CR>`) makes the selection unreplayable. \n\n",
